                "minimum": "<strong>Mínimos:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requer um sistema operativo e processador de 64 bits<br></li><li><strong>Sistema Operativo:</strong> Windows 10 64bit<br></li><li><strong>Processador:</strong> Intel® Core™ i5 5200U or similar<br></li><li><strong>Memória:</strong> 4 GB de RAM<br></li><li><strong>Placa gráfica:</strong> Intel® HD Graphics 5500 or similar<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Versão 11<br></li><li><strong>Espaço no disco:</strong> Requer 1500 MB de espaço livre<br></li><li><strong>Compatibilidade com R.V.:</strong> SteamVR or OpenXR<br></li><li><strong>Notas adicionais:</strong> Minimum requirement is for Non-VR play only. The faster your CPU, the better the game experience. This game is playable, but slow on slower CPUs.</li></ul>",
