                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Board Games VR is an Early Access free VR game.  It worked on my HTC Vive and Index system, looked ok, played ok, sounded ok.  You are in this drab room with some toys to manipulate and a table in middle of room.  No in-game instructions, tutorial or help.  Go to the table and use Menu button on your controller.  You can play Checker vs AI or Backgammon vs AI.  Could use more work. \n\nTry it for Free only and delete it.",
                        "timestamp_created": 1525982821,
